/*
  SuggestedPrompts.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0223 · SuggestedPrompts (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `SuggestedPrompts` resolves (table "SuggestedPrompts") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/system/components/chatbot/SuggestedPrompts.tsx): the four suggestion
  chips (i18nKey + defaultValue) and the `aria-label` on the strip. The second group
  backs the native chrome — the per-chip VoiceOver hint plus the P4 leaf freshness /
  loading / empty / error copy — so the Swift sources hold no English literals.
*/

